OL,3,GNEWSAWhy a boxer barred from becoming
OL,4,Achampion is being honoured
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was one of Britain's best boxers,
OL,7,Fbut never became champion.
OL,9,FBorn in Clayton, Manchester, in 1902,
OL,10,FLen Johnson won more than 90 fights
OL,11,Fduring his career but was barred from
OL,12,Fcontesting the British title because of
OL,13,Fthe colour of his skin.
OL,15,FHe later channelled the fighting spirit
OL,16,Fhe showed in the ring into campaigning
OL,17,Fagainst racism, becoming a trade
OL,18,Funionist, civil rights activist and
OL,19,Fmember of the Communist Party.
