OL,3,GNEWSAWhy a boxer barred from becoming
OL,4,Achampion is being honoured
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 50 years after his death,
OL,7,FJohnson is set to become the first
OL,8,Fblack person to be honoured with a
OL,9,Fstatue in Manchester. But who was Len
OL,10,FJohnson?
